# Mount Litera Zee School Wagholi-Pune - Environment Variables
# -------------------------------------------------------------

# Google Apps Script Web App Deployment URL
# Used to append incoming admission inquiries directly into Google Sheets.
# 
# How to obtain this URL:
# 1. Open your Google Sheet named "Mount Litera Admission Leads"
# 2. Go to Extensions -> Apps Script and paste the Code.gs script provided
# 3. Click "Deploy" -> "New deployment" -> Select type: "Web app"
# 4. Set Description: "Mount Litera Leads Endpoint"
# 5. Set "Execute as": "Me"
# 6. Set "Who has access": "Anyone"
# 7. Click "Deploy", authorize permissions, and copy the Web App URL (starts with https://script.google.com/macros/s/.../exec)
GOOGLE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL="https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbx_EXAMPLE_ID_HERE/exec"
